        "rule": "Replace every run of characters outside [a-z0-9] with one space, then trim.",
        "edgeCase": "Hyphen, slash, period and comma all become the same space, so 'Figure/Ground', 'Figure-Ground' and 'Figure Ground' are one key. That is why the map asserts key uniqueness rather than assuming it."
      }
